        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"732871c8-f75d-456b-b6f3-1328d14b4d0d\",\"review_text\":\"One word: GREEDY\"},{\"review_id\":\"2372ffe6-bd71-44f4-834e-5241e3b1a2f8\",\"review_text\":\"ITS LIKE U CAN LISTEN TO SONG AND ADD THEM TO UR PLAYLIST OR FAVS I LOVE IT BUT IT HAS SO MUSH ADS SOMETIMES Hearts♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♤♤♤♤♤♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♤♤♤♤♤♤♤♤♤♤♤♡♡♡♡♤♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♥︎♥︎♡♥︎♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♥︎♡♥︎♡♡♡♡♡♡♠︎◆♣︎♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡◇♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡\"},{\"review_id\":\"609ddf2e-57b7-45ee-9517-817b305a8418\",\"review_text\":\"All in all good app. I don't like library with mixed categories. When I drive my car and have to focus on road I want Library as simple as possible to navigate through my playlists.\"},{\"review_id\":\"1a9f9b34-cff5-45c5-bc07-c4483a7ec0d5\",\"review_text\":\"He are very good music lishing app\"},{\"review_id\":\"4e36c537-4929-4c65-9a23-6bbc6bc53cd3\",\"review_text\":\"Nise app\"},{\"review_id\":\"0cb02c26-d340-4daa-9f32-195f6058b946\",\"review_text\":\"Everyday is a magical search for Song and music that made up and fueled my life !!\"},{\"review_id\":\"e003564e-bda6-42ae-b070-ab29139ba5dd\",\"review_text\":\"Constantly Changing The Layout Makes For A Terrible Experience!! If They Would Only Bring All The Good Features Back & Make The Paid Experience Awesomely Whole, With All The Features In WiFi - Bluetooth & DATA sharing/casting and Full Screen Rotation, HD Sound, But Lacking That Experience Questions Weather To Pay For This Or Not, We're not missing out on anything with premium Really! The Ads Don't bother me!\"},{\"review_id\":\"d017d0cb-9657-4785-87b7-b25d56afbc31\",\"review_text\":\"buycode baycode mudabad suidun murda bad\"},{\"review_id\":\"b1883940-6b61-44a9-b90c-3719ada1499c\",\"review_text\":\"💯💯💯\"},{\"review_id\":\"455f67cb-da39-4869-b3d5-38519f2b9249\",\"review_text\":\"When using offline it takes forever to load\"}]}"
